---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Handmade solid wood kitchens, cabinetry, staircases, windows and doors, designed, made and fitted by cabinet maker Joel Dyter from his workshop in Hebden Bridge, West Yorkshire."
bodyClass: page-home
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cabinet maker · Hebden Bridge</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Handmade kitchens &amp; joinery, <em>made by the person you talk to.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Solid wood kitchens, cabinetry, staircases, windows and doors, designed, made and fitted by Joel Dyter in his own workshop. No showroom, no sales team: just one craftsman, start to finish.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start your project</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/projects/">See the work</a>
      </div>
      <a class="hero__wa" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappHref(site.whatsappMessage) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ icon("whatsapp", 18) }} Quick question? WhatsApp Joel</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      {% image "/images/projects/charcoal-shaker-kitchen/03.jpg", "Charcoal Shaker kitchen with an oak-topped island, handmade by Joel Dyter", "(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw", "", "eager" %}
      <p class="hero__tag">Charcoal Shaker kitchen · <a href="/projects/charcoal-shaker-kitchen/">see how it was made</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="trust">
      <li><strong>{{ site.yearsTrade }}+ years</strong> at the bench</li>
      <li><strong>Own workshop</strong> since {{ site.established }}</li>
      <li><strong>One maker</strong> from drawing to fitting</li>
      <li><strong>Solid timber</strong> with hand-cut joints</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What I make</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Made to measure, built to last</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="tiles">
      {%- set tileImages = {
        "kitchens": ["/images/projects/holland-kitchen-heptonstall/01.jpg", "Painted cottage kitchen in Heptonstall"],
        "bathrooms": ["/images/projects/washroom/01.jpg", "Painted washroom cabinetry"],
        "cabinetry": ["/images/projects/under-stairs-storage/01.jpg", "Painted under-stairs cupboards"],
        "furniture": ["/images/projects/farmhouse-dining-table/01.jpg", "Farmhouse dining table"],
        "staircases": ["/images/projects/staircases/05.jpg", "Winding oak staircase"],
        "windows-and-doors": ["/images/projects/oak-front-door/01.jpg", "Oak door in a stone arch"]
      } %}
      {%- asyncEach s in services %}
      <li class="tile">
        <a href="/{{ s.slug }}/">
          <div class="tile__media">{% image tileImages[s.slug][0], tileImages[s.slug][1], "(min-width: 1100px) 30vw, (min-width: 640px) 45vw, 92vw" %}</div>
          <h3 class="tile__title">{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split__media">{% image "/images/site/dovetail-drawer.jpg", "Hand-cut dovetails on a solid timber drawer", "(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw" %}</div>
    <div class="split__text prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">The maker</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">You deal with Joel, from first sketch to final scribe</h2>
      <p>I've been a joiner and cabinet maker for more than {{ site.yearsTrade }} years, and I've run my own workshop in the Calder Valley since {{ site.established }}. I work on my own, so the person who measures your room is the person who draws it, makes it and fits it.</p>
      <p>That means no hand-offs and nothing lost in translation. Drawers are dovetailed, carcasses are solid, and every piece is scribed to your walls, which in the old stone houses round here are never straight.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">How I work {{ icon("arrow", 16) }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Recent work</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">From the drawing board to your home</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">All projects</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      {%- asyncEach p in collections.projects | featured | limit(6) %}{% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}{% endeach %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Five steps, one maker</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Conversation</h3><p>Call, WhatsApp or send the form. Photos of the room and a rough idea of budget help me give you a straight answer.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Visit &amp; measure</h3><p>I come to see the space, talk through how you live in it, and take every measurement myself.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Drawings &amp; quote</h3><p>You get hand drawings and a complete, itemised price, so you know exactly what you're getting.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Making</h3><p>Everything is made in my Hebden Bridge workshop. I'll send you photos as it comes together.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fitting</h3><p>I fit it myself, scribing each piece to your walls and floors until it looks as if it has always been there.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/testimonials-scroll.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
